                 OverscriptBox[
                  StyleBox["q", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], "LL"]}], 
              TraditionalForm], 
             "\" (an operator on 16 fermion modes); the superfluid boson \
singlet state, its ground state, a coherent state of pairs; and the normal \
