                   SubscriptBox[
                    OverscriptBox[
                    StyleBox["q", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], "LL"], ")"}], 
                 "\[Dagger]"]}], TraditionalForm], 
             "\" removes a pair from the states of negative energy (creates a \
