              SubsuperscriptBox[
               StyleBox["W", "TI"], 
               RowBox[{"LL", ",", 
                 StyleBox["p", "TI"]}], "\[PlusMinus]"], TraditionalForm], 
             "\" and of the fermion-number vector field \"", 
             FormBox[
              SubsuperscriptBox[
               StyleBox["V", "TI"], 
               RowBox[{"LL", ",", 
