    GraphicsColor->RGBColor[0, 
      Rational[2, 3], 0],
    FontWeight->Bold,
    FontColor->RGBColor[0, 
      Rational[2, 3], 0]], "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\"GS-10\"\>", 
   "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\": \"\>", 
   "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\"the lattice operator H_lat on a 3 x 2 x 4 \
lattice (dx = 0.7, r_W = 1, periodic in x and z) with random links, \
potentials and order parameters is Hermitian, particle-hole symmetric and \
exactly gauge covariant; on a free periodic chain of 12 sites its spectrum is \
+-eps_lat, each eight times; the Wilson term lifts the doubler to m + 2 \
r_W/dx; the spectral radius stays below the bound Hbound (tolerance \
1e-10)\"\>", "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
   TemplateBox[{"\"  -- \"", 
